<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; How to Track Your Booking ID in Vehicle Transport
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What information do I need to enter to track my booking ID with national vehicle transport services?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To track your booking ID, you’ll need the 12‑digit alphanumeric ID provided at confirmation, the registered mobile number or email linked to the booking, and a valid OTP sent by the portal. Having your GSTIN and RTO registration number handy can also speed up verification.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How often is the GPS location of my vehicle updated on the tracking portal?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad’s satellite‑enabled GPS updates every five minutes during transit on the Delhi‑to‑Mumbai corridor. Real‑time status, including checkpoint timestamps at Varanasi, Prayagraj, and Kanpur, is displayed on the dashboard, ensuring transparent visibility until final delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track both my household goods and my car using the same booking ID?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. The integrated booking ID links all consignments under a single move—household items, two‑wheelers, and cars. The portal shows separate tabs for cargo type, each reflecting its own GPS trace, insurance coverage, and handling status while sharing the same tracking reference.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I do if the tracking status shows ‘stalled’ or no movement for several hours?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A ‘stalled’ status usually indicates a checkpoint hold or temporary GPS outage. Contact Shree Ashirwad’s 24/7 support line with your booking ID; they will verify driver logs, confirm toll clearance, and provide an updated ETA within 30 minutes.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the tracking service compatible with mobile apps or only the web portal?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers both a responsive web portal and a dedicated Android/iOS app. After entering your booking ID, you receive push notifications for each milestone—loading, highway entry, toll clearance, and delivery—so you can monitor the move on any device.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Does the tracking system include insurance claim status for my vehicle?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While the tracking dashboard focuses on location, it also displays a linked insurance panel showing policy number, coverage amount, and claim status. If any incident occurs, the system flags the event and provides a direct link to initiate a claim through the IRDAI‑approved insurer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the booking ID help with RTO compliance during interstate vehicle transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The booking ID encodes the RTO clearance code, ensuring the vehicle meets inter‑state transport regulations. At each state checkpoint, officials scan the ID to verify that the vehicle’s registration, insurance, and e‑Way bill are valid, streamlining legal compliance throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
